@startuml modify_account_sequence
title Detailed Sequence Diagram — Modify Account

actor User
participant "Profile Page\n(React)" as UI
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
participant "UtilisateurRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Load profile ==

User -> UI : Open profile page
UI -> Controller : GET /api/auth/me
Controller -> Service : me()
Service --> Controller : current user
Controller --> UI : user profile
UI --> User : Display editable form

== Update profile ==

User -> UI : Edit fields and submit
UI -> Controller : PUT /api/auth/update-profile
Controller -> Controller : Validate fields\n(role-based rules)

alt Validation fails
  Controller --> UI : 422 validation errors
  UI --> User : Display field errors
else Validation succeeds
  Controller -> Service : updateProfile(data)
  Service -> Repo : update(userId, data)
  Repo -> DB : UPDATE utilisateur
  DB --> Repo : ok
  Repo --> Service : updated
  Service --> Controller : refreshed user
  Controller --> UI : 200 OK + user
  UI -> UI : Update localStorage user
  UI --> User : Display success confirmation
end

@enduml
